  "name": "Zero2Hero++ Unheard Edition",
  "slug": "zero2hero-unheard-edition",
  "teaser": "SPT Zero To Hero but with Unheard stash and secure container :D\r\nYou also start with the Unheard Kukri instead of the normal knifes",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2287.png",
  "downloads": 13543,
  "favourites_count": 14,
  "description": "<p>it is based on a Unheard account preset but only retains the upgraded stash and the secure container, everything else should be the same as in normal Zero To Hero</p>\n<p>If you come across any bugs feel free to contact me on discord [thedevilsrevenge] you can tag me in the SPT discord or send me a DM</p>\n<h2>Install instructions</h2>\n<p>- Download latest release</p>\n<p>- Open the zip file and drag the user folder into your SPT folder</p>\n<p>- Startup SPT-Server and then you’re client</p>\n<p>- Create a new profile and select “Joey’s Zero to Hero ++ Unheard Edition</p>\n<h2>Install GIF</h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/34vXXDj\" alt=\"Install_GIF\" /></p>\n<h2>Known bugs</h2>\n<p>- None atm</p>\n<h2>Fixed bugs</h2>\n<p>- Cultist Circle is bugged atm (See comments) [Fixed in 1.0.2]</p>\n<p>- Insurance bugged [Fixed in 1.0.4]</p>\n",
